IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `je54-nouns`
IMPORT `je54-vintage`
IMPORT `je54-art12-15-penalties-forms`

-- je54-tests-art12-15-penalties-forms: Articles 12 to 15.  Expected values were written from the text of the Articles before this module was run.  The four Articles are the same in all seven deposited versions;
-- the same scenarios are put to every text.  The enactments named are made up for the test (the Alpha (Jersey) Law 2020, the Beta (Jersey) Law 2021 and the Gamma Regulations 2022): they are not real enactments.

`text V1` MEANS `V1, 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021`
`text V2a` MEANS `V2a, 28 September 2021 to 30 January 2022`
`text V2b` MEANS `V2b, 31 January 2022 to 31 August 2022`
`text V2c` MEANS `V2c, 1 September 2022 to 10 January 2024`
`text V2d` MEANS `V2d, 11 January 2024 to 23 November 2025`
`text V2e` MEANS `V2e, 24 November 2025 to 18 June 2026`
`text V2f` MEANS `V2f, 19 June 2026 to current`
`text inferred` MEANS `the inferred text from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018`
`text none` MEANS `no text before 28 March 2003`

GIVEN names IS A LIST OF STRING
      customary IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Offences arising from one act or omission`
`offences under` names `and the customary law` customary MEANS
    `Offences arising from one act or omission` WITH
        `the enactments that create the offences` IS names
        `it is also an offence under the customary law of Jersey` IS customary

`alpha` MEANS "the Alpha (Jersey) Law 2020"
`beta` MEANS "the Beta (Jersey) Law 2021"
`gamma` MEANS "the Gamma Regulations 2022"
`alpha and beta` MEANS `offences under` (LIST `alpha`, `beta`) `and the customary law` FALSE
`alpha and the customary law` MEANS `offences under` (LIST `alpha`) `and the customary law` TRUE
`alpha only` MEANS `offences under` (LIST `alpha`) `and the customary law` FALSE
`alpha twice` MEANS `offences under` (LIST `alpha`, `alpha`) `and the customary law` FALSE
`alpha twice and the customary law` MEANS `offences under` (LIST `alpha`, `alpha`) `and the customary law` TRUE
`alpha twice and beta` MEANS `offences under` (LIST `alpha`, `alpha`, `beta`) `and the customary law` FALSE
`the customary law only` MEANS `offences under` (LIST) `and the customary law` TRUE
`no offence` MEANS `offences under` (LIST) `and the customary law` FALSE

§ `Article 12: an act or omission that is an offence under 2 or more enactments, or under an enactment and the customary law`

#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V1` `alpha and beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2a` `alpha and beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2b` `alpha and beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2c` `alpha and beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2d` `alpha and beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2e` `alpha and beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2f` `alpha and beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V1` `alpha and beta` `alpha` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V1` `alpha and beta` `beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2a` `alpha and beta` `alpha` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2a` `alpha and beta` `beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2b` `alpha and beta` `alpha` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2b` `alpha and beta` `beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2c` `alpha and beta` `alpha` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2c` `alpha and beta` `beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2d` `alpha and beta` `alpha` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2d` `alpha and beta` `beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2e` `alpha and beta` `alpha` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2e` `alpha and beta` `beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2f` `alpha and beta` `alpha` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2f` `alpha and beta` `beta` FALSE
-- Neither the customary law (it is not an offence under it) nor an enactment that does not create the offence.
-- Corrected after the independent pass (NOTES 10.3, row O09t): the first two of these asserted FALSE; the Article names its routes and does not say about another, so they refuse; two more refusals are added.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2f` `alpha and beta` `the customary law of Jersey` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under either or any of the enactments that create the offences, or under the customary law of Jersey where the act is an offence under it; it does not say whether the offender may be prosecuted and punished under any other route"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V1` `alpha and beta` `gamma` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under either or any of the enactments that create the offences, or under the customary law of Jersey where the act is an offence under it; it does not say whether the offender may be prosecuted and punished under any other route"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V1` `alpha and beta` `the customary law of Jersey` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under either or any of the enactments that create the offences, or under the customary law of Jersey where the act is an offence under it; it does not say whether the offender may be prosecuted and punished under any other route"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2c` `alpha and beta` `gamma` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under either or any of the enactments that create the offences, or under the customary law of Jersey where the act is an offence under it; it does not say whether the offender may be prosecuted and punished under any other route"
-- An enactment and the customary law: either, or any.
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V1` `alpha and the customary law` `alpha` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2f` `alpha and the customary law` `the customary law of Jersey` FALSE
-- Corrected after the independent pass (NOTES 10.3, row O09t): this asserted FALSE and now refuses; the V1 pair is added (the customary route when the act is an offence under it, and a route that is not named).
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2f` `alpha and the customary law` `beta` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under either or any of the enactments that create the offences, or under the customary law of Jersey where the act is an offence under it; it does not say whether the offender may be prosecuted and punished under any other route"
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V1` `alpha and the customary law` `the customary law of Jersey` FALSE
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V1` `alpha and the customary law` `beta` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under either or any of the enactments that create the offences, or under the customary law of Jersey where the act is an offence under it; it does not say whether the offender may be prosecuted and punished under any other route"
-- Three sources.
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2c` (`offences under` (LIST `alpha`, `beta`, `gamma`) `and the customary law` TRUE) `gamma` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2c` (`offences under` (LIST `alpha`, `beta`, `gamma`) `and the customary law` TRUE) `the customary law of Jersey` FALSE
-- One enactment named twice is not "2 or more enactments", but with the customary law it is an enactment and the customary law; alpha twice and beta is two enactments.
#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2f` `alpha twice and the customary law` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V1` `alpha twice and beta` FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2a` `alpha twice and beta` `beta` FALSE
-- Where the Article does not apply it refuses, with the reason.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V1` `alpha twice` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says nothing about an act or omission that constitutes two offences under the same enactment"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2f` `alpha twice` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says nothing about an act or omission that constitutes two offences under the same enactment"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2f` `alpha only` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 deals only where an act or omission constitutes an offence under 2 or more enactments, or both under an enactment and under the customary law of Jersey"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V1` `the customary law only` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 deals only where an act or omission constitutes an offence under 2 or more enactments, or both under an enactment and under the customary law of Jersey"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2c` `no offence` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 deals only where an act or omission constitutes an offence under 2 or more enactments, or both under an enactment and under the customary law of Jersey"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text V2f` `alpha twice` `alpha` FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says nothing about an act or omission that constitutes two offences under the same enactment"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the Article applies` `text V2f` `alpha and beta` TRUE
        BECAUSE "a contrary intention appears: Article 12 does not say under what the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the Article applies` `text inferred` `alpha and beta` FALSE
        BECAUSE "before the first consolidated version (1 January 2019)"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished under` `text none` `alpha and beta` `alpha` FALSE
        BECAUSE "before the first consolidated version (1 January 2019)"

-- "but shall not be liable to be punished twice for the same offence".

#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V1` `alpha and beta` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2a` `alpha and beta` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2b` `alpha and beta` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2c` `alpha and beta` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2d` `alpha and beta` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2e` `alpha and beta` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2f` `alpha and beta` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V1` `alpha and beta` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2a` `alpha and beta` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2b` `alpha and beta` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2c` `alpha and beta` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2d` `alpha and beta` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2e` `alpha and beta` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2f` `alpha and beta` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2f` `alpha and the customary law` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V1` `alpha and the customary law` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V2f` `alpha twice` FALSE FALSE
        BECAUSE "Article 12 says nothing about an act or omission that constitutes two offences under the same enactment"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text V1` `alpha and beta` FALSE TRUE
        BECAUSE "a contrary intention appears: Article 12 does not say under what the offender is liable to be prosecuted and punished"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 12: the offender is liable to be punished` `text inferred` `alpha and beta` FALSE FALSE
        BECAUSE "before the first consolidated version (1 January 2019)"

